WEBVTT

00:00:00.710 --> 00:00:03.420
The first fight of the first round, A Block:

00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:07.500
Aichi Sendou vs. Yuuta Izaki!

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:09.480
The first fight, B Block:

00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:12.820
Katsumi Morikawa vs. Misaki Tokura!

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:15.820
My first shop tournament...

00:00:15.820 --> 00:00:19.490
I was so nervous, it was 
like I wasn't myself...

00:00:20.760 --> 00:00:24.060
But, I realized that everyone 
else was the same way!

00:00:24.060 --> 00:00:25.750
And I managed to win against Izaki.

00:00:33.470 --> 00:00:35.220
Stealth Beast, Hagakure!

00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:44.030
I will show you just how fearsome my 
Nubatama ninja forces truly are-degozaru!

00:00:44.900 --> 00:00:47.700
Ninja Art: Clone Technique!

00:00:54.870 --> 00:00:56.930
And then, Mr. Mark...

00:00:56.930 --> 00:00:59.750
I mean, Ninja Master M was my next fight.

00:01:00.050 --> 00:01:02.250
It was a hard battle, but a lot of fun!

00:01:10.460 --> 00:01:12.270
Thanks for waiting!

00:01:12.270 --> 00:01:15.470
We will now draw the brackets 
for the tournament finals!

00:01:16.020 --> 00:01:20.480
There are slips of paper with the 
numbers 1 through 4 inside this box.

00:01:20.480 --> 00:01:25.550
Each of the four fighters will draw 
one to decide their positions.

00:01:25.550 --> 00:01:28.300
Now, we'll start with Aichi.

00:01:29.810 --> 00:01:30.550
Here.

00:01:31.850 --> 00:01:32.700
Right.

00:01:35.760 --> 00:01:38.410
Now, it's finally time to open them up!

00:01:38.930 --> 00:01:43.200
This might decide if I have 
a match against Kai...

00:01:43.790 --> 00:01:46.040
Now, go on!

00:01:48.710 --> 00:01:51.270
And then... And then...

00:01:51.270 --> 00:01:52.750
The finals of the tournament!

00:01:53.020 --> 00:01:54.080
One!

00:01:54.080 --> 00:01:54.980
Four.

00:01:56.140 --> 00:01:57.470
I'm three.

00:01:58.230 --> 00:01:59.560
Which means...

00:01:59.560 --> 00:02:01.980
My opponent will be you, Brother.

00:02:02.900 --> 00:02:06.610
So, I'm fighting Kamui... 
If I can beat him...

00:02:07.780 --> 00:02:12.070
I'm not going to hold back, even 
if you're my opponent, Brother!

00:02:14.100 --> 00:02:16.350
Right! I wouldn't have it any other way!

00:03:49.470 --> 00:03:51.830
Finally, it is time to begin

00:03:52.290 --> 00:03:54.700
the finals of Card Capital's Shop Tournament!

00:03:54.700 --> 00:03:56.840
We will hold both fights at the same time!

00:03:56.840 --> 00:03:57.900
First up:

00:03:58.480 --> 00:04:01.310
Toshiki Kai vs. Misaki Tokura!

00:04:02.170 --> 00:04:03.420
And then:

00:04:03.420 --> 00:04:06.910
Aichi Sedou vs. Kamui Katsuragi!

00:04:07.350 --> 00:04:12.140
If you can go on to win the tournament, 
you'll finally get to marry your goddess!

00:04:12.140 --> 00:04:13.530
MG, yo!

00:04:14.810 --> 00:04:15.970
Yup, guess so.

00:04:18.720 --> 00:04:22.530
But I can't underestimate Aichi's skills...

00:04:23.060 --> 00:04:24.700
I'll fight him with everything I've got!

00:04:25.220 --> 00:04:29.490
Anyway, you've come this far, 
so do your best to win, okay?

00:04:29.490 --> 00:04:31.860
I'll make a special dinner for you!

00:04:31.860 --> 00:04:34.010
Thanks! I'll try my best.

00:04:35.090 --> 00:04:37.550
I'm up against Kamui... 
He's a strong opponent.

00:04:38.080 --> 00:04:38.920
But...

00:04:40.260 --> 00:04:44.320
If I can win this fight, I might 
be able to finally fight Kai again!

00:04:46.310 --> 00:04:47.470
This fight...

00:04:48.110 --> 00:04:49.660
I want to win it, no matter what!

00:04:50.530 --> 00:04:52.980
Please decide who will be going first.

00:04:53.450 --> 00:04:55.730
Whoever wins at rock-paper-scissors 
will go first.

00:04:56.260 --> 00:04:58.120
First comes rock!

00:04:58.120 --> 00:04:58.730
Ready, set...

00:04:59.000 --> 00:04:59.640
Go!

00:05:01.680 --> 00:05:05.020
Oh, no! The Great Kamui won!

00:05:05.020 --> 00:05:06.800
That means you'll have to go first!

00:05:06.800 --> 00:05:09.780
Major mistake! MM, yo!

00:05:10.780 --> 00:05:14.660
Oh yeah... I remember you 
said you liked going second.

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:18.130
Yeah. That's because the player that 
goes second gets to attack first.

00:05:18.130 --> 00:05:18.790
But...

00:05:19.290 --> 00:05:24.550
If I fight to my full potential, I'll 
win whether I go first or second!

00:05:24.550 --> 00:05:27.150
Yup. I'll give it my all, too.

00:05:27.640 --> 00:05:30.100
I can't lose to you, Kamui! Not today!

00:05:30.510 --> 00:05:33.350
Nice... Looks like things are heating up.

00:05:33.750 --> 00:05:35.960
Shin, we've decided over here, too.

00:05:36.580 --> 00:05:38.020
Please call me "manager", remember?

00:05:38.590 --> 00:05:40.480
Will both sides please get ready.

00:05:48.300 --> 00:05:51.550
He's the strongest player
among this shop's customers.

00:05:53.300 --> 00:05:54.750
Misaki Tokura...

00:05:55.330 --> 00:05:58.440
She has a perfect memory of 
Vanguard fights, but that's all.

00:05:58.440 --> 00:06:00.000
I'm not holding back.

00:06:07.680 --> 00:06:09.470
Now then, here we go!

00:06:09.470 --> 00:06:11.180
Start the fights!

00:06:11.390 --> 00:06:13.750
Stand up! Vanguard!

00:06:13.750 --> 00:06:15.350
Lizard Runner Undeux!

00:06:16.110 --> 00:06:17.680
Lozenge Magus.

00:06:18.220 --> 00:06:19.800
Battleraizer!

00:06:21.120 --> 00:06:22.200
Barcgal!

00:06:38.160 --> 00:06:43.130
Aichi vs. Kamui

00:06:45.640 --> 00:06:48.010
I ain't holding back, Brother!

00:06:48.220 --> 00:06:50.760
Right. Let's both give it our all!

00:06:53.570 --> 00:06:56.520
I, the great Kamui, ride Tough Boy!

00:07:00.650 --> 00:07:03.360
I move Battleraizer to the rear-guard!

00:07:04.080 --> 00:07:05.570
It's your turn, Brother.

00:07:11.220 --> 00:07:13.580
I ride the Little Sage, Marron!

00:07:17.460 --> 00:07:19.540
I move Barcgal to the read-guard.

00:07:20.080 --> 00:07:23.050
I call Flogal and the Transporter 
of Good Luck, Epona!

00:07:27.140 --> 00:07:29.300
Now, if you don't mind, I'll attack.

00:07:29.800 --> 00:07:31.260
Go right ahead, Brother.

00:07:31.910 --> 00:07:35.670
I boost Flogal with Epona, 
and attack Tough Boy!

00:07:40.620 --> 00:07:42.480
Damage trigger check.

00:07:42.750 --> 00:07:46.280
I attack Tough Boy with 
Marron, boosted by Barcgal!

00:07:50.380 --> 00:07:52.040
Drive trigger check.

00:07:58.300 --> 00:08:00.330
Damage trigger check...

00:08:01.670 --> 00:08:03.000
I end my turn.

00:08:03.760 --> 00:08:06.630
Going at it right from the start, Brother?

00:08:06.630 --> 00:08:08.420
Now it's my turn!

00:08:11.430 --> 00:08:15.180
Miss Emi... Watch my awesome -- 
I mean, endearing -- victory!

00:08:15.620 --> 00:08:18.710
Little me rides Genocide Jack!

00:08:19.660 --> 00:08:20.890
"Little me"?

00:08:26.930 --> 00:08:28.360
Genocide Jack!

00:08:28.890 --> 00:08:31.280
When I fought Kamui before,

00:08:31.280 --> 00:08:33.920
that unit dealt a lot of damage in one shot.

00:08:36.440 --> 00:08:39.120
But I won't let that happen today!

00:08:39.390 --> 00:08:43.320
I call the King of Sword, 
Shining Lady, and Lucky Girl!

00:08:46.350 --> 00:08:50.400
I rev Genocide up to full 
speed with a Counterblast!

00:08:57.050 --> 00:09:00.380
Here it comes! The all-out 
attack right from the get-go!

00:09:00.380 --> 00:09:03.570
This is the great Kamui's 
opening attack! KO, yo!

00:09:04.980 --> 00:09:08.150
I attack Marron with the King of Sword!

00:09:12.090 --> 00:09:13.750
Damage trigger check.

00:09:13.750 --> 00:09:14.620
All right!

00:09:15.090 --> 00:09:16.650
Critical trigger!

00:09:16.650 --> 00:09:18.670
Marron's power is +5000!

00:09:19.170 --> 00:09:21.320
Marron's power is now 13000.

00:09:21.620 --> 00:09:24.340
Your attacks won't get through so easily now!

00:09:25.340 --> 00:09:26.250
True.

00:09:26.470 --> 00:09:30.410
These two won't be enough to cause damage.

00:09:30.410 --> 00:09:33.470
But Genocide Jack's another story!

00:09:33.950 --> 00:09:35.790
I boost with Lucky Girl,

00:09:36.100 --> 00:09:38.390
and attack with Genocide Jack!

00:09:42.320 --> 00:09:45.290
Plus, I activate Genocide Jack's skill!

00:09:45.290 --> 00:09:48.150
When it's boosted by the 
Nova Grappler, Lucky Girl,

00:09:48.150 --> 00:09:50.030
its power is +5000!

00:09:50.030 --> 00:09:52.690
Whoa! Power 21000?!

00:09:55.650 --> 00:09:57.350
Drive trigger check!

00:10:00.980 --> 00:10:02.780
Damage trigger check.

00:10:04.910 --> 00:10:09.930
I boost Shining Lady with 
Battleraizer and attack Flogal!

00:10:09.930 --> 00:10:12.200
Plus, with Battleraizer's skill,

00:10:12.200 --> 00:10:14.940
Shining Lady's power is +3000!

00:10:25.150 --> 00:10:26.770
I see.

00:10:26.770 --> 00:10:28.250
Hmm, I see!

00:10:28.250 --> 00:10:33.280
Since he can't succeed in attacking the 
Vanguard, he's thinning out the other units instead.

00:10:33.280 --> 00:10:36.910
I choose to return Battleraizer to my deck.

00:10:36.910 --> 00:10:39.560
Looks like the fight over 
there's even more interesting!

00:10:39.560 --> 00:10:40.520
Let's go!

00:10:40.520 --> 00:10:41.570
Sure...

00:10:41.570 --> 00:10:44.040
We're in the middle of a fight! Be quiet.

00:10:44.040 --> 00:10:45.340
Right...

00:10:48.460 --> 00:10:52.010
You'll never get a girlfriend 
doing stuff like that.

00:10:52.010 --> 00:10:55.280
Shut up, you! Vanguard is my girlfriend!

00:10:55.280 --> 00:10:57.960
Oh? What happened to Kourin?

00:10:57.960 --> 00:10:59.450
Shut it, Izaki!

00:10:59.450 --> 00:11:00.690
Ahem.

00:11:01.700 --> 00:11:04.150
Will the middle school students 
over there please be quiet?

00:11:04.150 --> 00:11:05.860
You're disturbing everyone.

00:11:05.860 --> 00:11:07.350
What? Me, too?

00:11:07.350 --> 00:11:08.700
We're sorry...

00:11:08.700 --> 00:11:09.900
Sheesh.

00:11:10.590 --> 00:11:14.290
Whatever. Just watch Aichi's fight quietly.

00:11:14.290 --> 00:11:15.020
Sure...

00:11:17.810 --> 00:11:20.530
Last time, I took 4 damage from that guy.

00:11:21.470 --> 00:11:24.490
But today I managed to keep it to 2!

00:11:25.160 --> 00:11:27.630
Okay! It's my turn now!

00:11:40.580 --> 00:11:43.160
Okay... It's my turn now!

00:11:46.120 --> 00:11:48.620
I ride the Knight of Silence, Gallatin!

00:11:52.200 --> 00:11:53.600
I call Marron!

00:11:54.020 --> 00:11:57.850
I attack Genocide Jack with 
Marron, boosted by Epona!

00:12:06.130 --> 00:12:07.930
Damage trigger check.

00:12:07.930 --> 00:12:09.700
I got a stand trigger!

00:12:09.700 --> 00:12:12.490
Genocide Jack's power is +5000!

00:12:12.490 --> 00:12:15.190
Plus, I will stand the King of Sword!

00:12:17.430 --> 00:12:21.070
If I attack Genocide Jack, 
I won't have enough power.

00:12:22.360 --> 00:12:23.940
I boost with Barcgal,

00:12:23.940 --> 00:12:26.690
and attack the King of Sword with Gallatin!

00:12:27.070 --> 00:12:28.700
Drive trigger check.

00:12:36.060 --> 00:12:38.510
Then I guess it's my turn.

00:12:38.510 --> 00:12:40.860
I was only just getting started!

00:12:43.320 --> 00:12:45.680
The great Kamui rides...

00:12:45.680 --> 00:12:49.670
the impervious hero exploding 
onto the scene! Mr. Invincible!

00:12:59.810 --> 00:13:01.790
I move Shining Lady.

00:13:01.790 --> 00:13:04.690
And I call Mr. Invincible and Genocide Jack!

00:13:08.180 --> 00:13:10.180
Another Genocide Jack?

00:13:10.450 --> 00:13:12.980
I Soulcharge with Invincible's skill!

00:13:15.690 --> 00:13:18.300
He flipped a damage card over?

00:13:18.300 --> 00:13:20.890
It's very handy for Genocide Jack.

00:13:20.890 --> 00:13:24.350
It needs to Counterblast 
to attack, after all.

00:13:24.350 --> 00:13:26.240
Counter... what?

00:13:26.240 --> 00:13:28.600
You mean that Aichi's at a disadvantage?

00:13:28.600 --> 00:13:29.970
Yup, that's right.

00:13:29.970 --> 00:13:33.330
But you know, you should really 
cheer for your future husband!

00:13:33.330 --> 00:13:35.650
Please, don't say such ridiculous things!

00:13:35.650 --> 00:13:37.170
Aichi, don't lose!

00:13:37.170 --> 00:13:40.910
That annoying Genocide 
Jack, and a grade 3, too!

00:13:41.450 --> 00:13:44.180
Aichi Sendou... How will you withstand it?

00:13:44.180 --> 00:13:47.960
I Counterblast to rev Genocide 
Jack up to full speed!

00:13:48.600 --> 00:13:50.800
I guard with the Knight of Rose, Morgana!

00:13:54.540 --> 00:13:55.710
I'm not done yet!

00:13:55.710 --> 00:13:58.760
I attack with Invincible, 
boosted by Lucky Girl!

00:13:59.200 --> 00:14:01.650
Even if I guard, it won't be enough...

00:14:01.650 --> 00:14:04.110
Twin drive, first check!

00:14:04.110 --> 00:14:05.480
Second check.

00:14:08.350 --> 00:14:10.100
Damage trigger check.

00:14:12.280 --> 00:14:15.770
I attack with Invincible, 
boosted by Shining Lady!

00:14:18.330 --> 00:14:19.510
I guard with Llew!

00:14:26.310 --> 00:14:27.840
I end my turn.

00:14:29.500 --> 00:14:32.020
He managed to get away with only 1 damage.

00:14:32.020 --> 00:14:36.000
Before, Aichi was torn to shreds 
from just one Genocide Jack!

00:14:36.000 --> 00:14:38.040
He's sure takin' a shot at it.

00:14:38.040 --> 00:14:39.560
Aichi, you little...

00:14:42.880 --> 00:14:43.860
Okay.

00:14:44.110 --> 00:14:46.480
It's time for me to attack with all I've got!

00:14:47.440 --> 00:14:50.610
Please, lend me the power to lead!

00:14:51.610 --> 00:14:54.580
Enter the fray, king of all knights!

00:14:54.580 --> 00:14:57.810
Ride, the King of Knights, Alfred!

00:15:01.660 --> 00:15:05.030
And I call Blaster Blade to the rear-guard!

00:15:09.860 --> 00:15:12.170
Blaster Blade as a rear-guard?

00:15:12.170 --> 00:15:15.520
But he's always been placed 
in the Vanguard circle!

00:15:16.890 --> 00:15:21.650
For Blaster Blade, when a Royal Paladin 
unit is in the Vanguard circle,

00:15:21.650 --> 00:15:26.570
he can retire a grade 2 or lower 
rear-guard unit using his Counterblast.

00:15:27.190 --> 00:15:28.570
And I choose...

00:15:29.100 --> 00:15:30.580
Genocide Jack!

00:15:51.560 --> 00:15:54.240
He blasted away that Genocide Jack!

00:15:54.240 --> 00:15:55.730
Good going, Aichi.

00:15:55.730 --> 00:15:59.870
But I never knew Blaster 
Blade had that skill...

00:15:59.870 --> 00:16:01.550
Yo, Lose-umi!

00:16:01.550 --> 00:16:03.970
I'm "Katsumi", damn it!

00:16:04.500 --> 00:16:07.700
You didn't even know something that basic?

00:16:08.560 --> 00:16:11.320
B-Blaster Blade's just a grade 2!

00:16:11.320 --> 00:16:14.230
I ain't got no interest in units like that.

00:16:14.230 --> 00:16:16.550
Oh, I get it.

00:16:16.550 --> 00:16:18.800
Barcgal, call your ally!

00:16:19.490 --> 00:16:20.870
Come out, Flogal!

00:16:23.150 --> 00:16:24.830
I boost with Flogal,

00:16:24.830 --> 00:16:28.460
and attack your Vanguard 
Invincible with Blaster Blade!

00:16:32.290 --> 00:16:33.760
I guard with Shout!

00:16:37.970 --> 00:16:40.460
I didn't sign up for this!

00:16:40.900 --> 00:16:42.570
I attack with Alfred.

00:16:42.900 --> 00:16:48.310
Alfred uses the powers of his Royal 
Paladin allies to make his power 20000!

00:16:52.900 --> 00:16:54.450
I don't guard.

00:16:56.520 --> 00:16:57.760
Twin Drive!

00:16:57.760 --> 00:16:58.980
First check.

00:17:00.590 --> 00:17:02.040
Second check.

00:17:11.410 --> 00:17:13.210
Damage trigger check.

00:17:14.380 --> 00:17:17.050
I attack with Marron, boosted by Epona!

00:17:18.930 --> 00:17:20.680
I guard with Shout!

00:17:20.680 --> 00:17:22.890
Is this really necessary?

00:17:24.600 --> 00:17:26.190
My turn is over.

00:17:26.600 --> 00:17:28.880
Indeed, it is attack, and then retreat!

00:17:29.270 --> 00:17:30.620
When did you...

00:17:30.620 --> 00:17:33.190
It is truly a clashing between 
two great warriors-degozaru.

00:17:33.190 --> 00:17:34.260
Gozaru?

00:17:34.260 --> 00:17:36.550
Oh! G-Go...

00:17:36.550 --> 00:17:40.430
...the distance! I mean, they 
should keep it up to the end, yes!

00:17:40.430 --> 00:17:43.010
Nice! Give this man a cookie! 
Don't got any, though.

00:17:44.310 --> 00:17:46.420
I stand and draw!

00:17:46.420 --> 00:17:48.780
He has two grade 3 units...

00:17:48.780 --> 00:17:51.430
But I have to make it 
through this turn somehow!

00:17:51.730 --> 00:17:54.930
And on my next turn, I'll finish it!

00:17:56.070 --> 00:17:59.110
I Soulcharge with Invincible's skill!

00:18:02.890 --> 00:18:04.890
I boost with Shining Lady,

00:18:04.890 --> 00:18:06.840
and attack with Invincible!

00:18:10.100 --> 00:18:11.740
Damage trigger...

00:18:11.740 --> 00:18:12.850
Nothing.

00:18:12.850 --> 00:18:15.710
I think it's about time 
we finished this, Brother.

00:18:17.560 --> 00:18:19.240
I boost with Lucky Girl,

00:18:19.240 --> 00:18:22.120
and attack Alfred with Invincible!

00:18:23.330 --> 00:18:24.440
C-Crap!

00:18:24.440 --> 00:18:27.760
If a critical trigger shows 
up with this attack...

00:18:27.760 --> 00:18:28.910
Aichi...

00:18:30.030 --> 00:18:31.180
I guard!

00:18:32.170 --> 00:18:34.170
The Flash Shield, Isolde!

00:18:36.960 --> 00:18:38.820
I activate Isolde's skill!

00:18:38.820 --> 00:18:42.560
By dropping a card from my 
hand, I nullify your attack!

00:18:43.540 --> 00:18:48.400
I see! If the hit is nullified, then the 
drive trigger would be nullified, too!

00:18:48.400 --> 00:18:49.070
Right?

00:18:49.960 --> 00:18:52.230
O-Of course, right...

00:18:54.230 --> 00:18:56.690
Twin drive, first check.

00:19:00.230 --> 00:19:01.580
Second check...

00:19:05.610 --> 00:19:07.330
A critical trigger!

00:19:07.330 --> 00:19:08.880
Damage +1!

00:19:08.880 --> 00:19:11.710
He really would have taken 2 damage!

00:19:16.990 --> 00:19:18.550
I end my turn...

00:19:21.650 --> 00:19:23.680
Thank you, Isolde...

00:19:25.370 --> 00:19:27.880
Isolde, Blaster Blade...

00:19:27.880 --> 00:19:30.250
Aichi, you've used them to 
their fullest potential.

00:19:30.250 --> 00:19:31.490
Final turn.

00:19:34.030 --> 00:19:35.540
Hey, it's not over yet!

00:19:36.870 --> 00:19:39.030
I should be able to defend with this hand.

00:19:39.940 --> 00:19:42.670
The units that he can attack with are

00:19:43.030 --> 00:19:45.740
two Nehalems and a Vortex Dragon.

00:19:46.440 --> 00:19:49.620
I'll guard the first Nehalem's 
attack with Lozenge.

00:19:50.080 --> 00:19:53.700
Next will be Vortex... If I have to, I'll 
use up the rest of my hand guarding...

00:19:55.230 --> 00:19:57.560
As long as he doesn't draw 
a trigger, Lozenge...

00:19:57.560 --> 00:19:59.060
Hoping for a trigger?

00:19:59.700 --> 00:20:02.490
You do not give up the 
fight, I'll give you that.

00:20:02.490 --> 00:20:04.090
But this is as far as you'll go.

00:20:07.380 --> 00:20:08.240
Draw.

00:20:08.890 --> 00:20:12.460
I attack Amaterasu with 
Nehalem, boosted by Aermo!

00:20:12.460 --> 00:20:14.310
I guard with Lozenge Magus!

00:20:17.540 --> 00:20:18.890
Not yet...

00:20:18.890 --> 00:20:20.280
I'll defend, you'll see!

00:20:26.120 --> 00:20:29.370
I have to withstand his attack somehow...

00:20:30.280 --> 00:20:32.910
I boost Vortex Dragon with Jarran,

00:20:33.140 --> 00:20:35.170
and attack Amaterasu!

00:20:38.820 --> 00:20:41.360
I guard with Maiden of Libra and Milk!

00:20:44.470 --> 00:20:48.260
I've used up all my hand, but 
that's plenty of protective power.

00:20:48.260 --> 00:20:50.770
As long as he doesn't get a drive trigger...

00:20:51.910 --> 00:20:53.270
Twin drive.

00:20:53.270 --> 00:20:54.540
First check.

00:20:55.520 --> 00:20:57.380
I stand and draw!

00:20:57.910 --> 00:20:58.820
Here...

00:20:58.820 --> 00:21:00.860
Here I will decide it!

00:21:04.280 --> 00:21:06.360
I got a drive trigger.

00:21:11.710 --> 00:21:16.510
From the stand trigger, I raise 
Vortex Dragon's power +5000,

00:21:16.510 --> 00:21:18.510
and stand up Nehalem!

00:21:39.900 --> 00:21:43.530
I used up all my hand, but I still 
wasn't able to defend them all...

00:21:51.270 --> 00:21:54.190
Toshiki Kai vs. Misaki Tokura!

00:21:54.190 --> 00:21:55.700
The winner is Kai!

00:21:58.680 --> 00:22:00.150
He's strong, all right...

00:22:00.150 --> 00:22:02.540
Girly's got game, though!

00:22:03.100 --> 00:22:04.510
Kai won.

00:22:05.980 --> 00:22:07.010
Kai...

00:23:52.130 --> 00:23:53.280
Brother Aichi,

00:23:53.280 --> 00:23:57.230
I know very well how you want to 
beat me so you can fight Kai again.

00:23:57.230 --> 00:24:01.690
But I'll show him a thing or two myself 
in the final fight, so leave it to me!

00:24:01.870 --> 00:24:05.540
Got it! I'll make sure you give it 120%!

00:24:05.540 --> 00:24:08.430
I'll give it more than anyone's ever given in 
history! My entire body will scream with pain!

00:24:08.430 --> 00:24:11.460
Uh... Sometimes I don't 
understand you, Kamui.

00:24:11.460 --> 00:24:14.170
Next time: The End of the Shop Tournament!

00:24:14.170 --> 00:24:17.760
I guess he meant "I'll give 
it my entire body and soul."
